<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0703_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ian</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm. If you transferred into my class,\nI’d be the second-best student\fin my class, wouldn’t I?\rI wanna get stronger before that\nhappen, so would you swap\fnumbers with me?\rThen we can have\nscraps together! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dope. I’ll hit you when I’m\nready to scrap again!\rYou can call me too!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wait...don’t tell me you serious\nabout transferrin’ to my school?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm. If you transferred into my class,\nI’d be the second-best student\fin my class, wouldn’t I!\rBefore that happen, I wanna scrap\nyou more so I can get WAY\fstronger! Let’s swap numbers.\rThen we can have\nscraps together! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here’s somethin’ to say thanks\nfor scrappin’ me!\fHere you go--have a Berry!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? Wait, where you at?\nI’m pretty sure you right nearby.\rIf you gon’ come all the way over\nhere, feel free to walk up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I learned a lot from\nwatchin’ you scrap, and I been\fpracticin’ with my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\rThanks to you, we got WAY better!\rBut even though we got stronger,\nyou prob’ly got stronger at\fthe same time, I guess.\rSo...that mean we still can’t\nbeat you, I guess!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I used tips I got from watchin’\nyou scrap to take down a wild\f{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} the other day!\rThanks to you, my homie WAY\nstronger!\rIf we get to meet again,\nI hope you show me more tricks!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, ayo, listen up!\rA few days ago, I was tryna catch a\nwild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}...\rIt went down to the wire, but it\nended up dippin’!\rI REALLY shoulda had a bunch of\nHood Balls ready, I know...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, lately I been wantin’ to\nscrap you again... What you say?\rYou down?\nI’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? Didn’t we make plans to meet\non {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} for a scrap?\rNo way you forgot!\nGet movin’, already!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0703_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know why I’m always in shorts?\rIt’s ’cause they HARD!\rYou know how, if you scrape your knees\nand you wearin’ shorts, everybody\fcan see the bandages?\fIt make me look wild and dangerous!</language>
	</row>
</body>
